    metaTitle: "Marketing Automation Strategic Guide for Attorneys",
    excerpt: "A strategic decision framework for attorneys deciding which marketing tasks are genuinely worth automating.",
    metaDescription: "Not every marketing task is worth automating — this strategic framework helps attorneys decide which tasks genuinely benefit from automation and which don't.",
    category: "Tools & Technology",
    readTime: "7 min read",
